  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effects of Land Use Transfer on GHGs &amp; Adaptation to Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement is a continuation of a previous project, CHN-2152, 14/0028, Developing Syngergistic Policy: Mitigation and Adaptiona Co-Benefits. 

The planned effects for the target group of the Project are to increase understanding of the effects of land use rights transfers on the emission of greenhouse gases, adaptation to climate change and farmers&apos; livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
